# Close delivery — local

When `JIRA_TASKS=OFF`:

1. Verify validation lane report APROVADO
2. Update `docs/workflow/next_actions.md` — mark item done
3. Update `docs/workflow/features/<slug>/tasks.md` if exists
4. Complete `docs/workflow/merge-checklist.md` if not using GitHub PRs

Delivery ID = handoff `name` slug.
